WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:05.480
Though it's unorthodox but I know quite a bit of medicine.

00:05.560 --> 00:08.920
Anyone under grandfather with injuries or illness I handle them all.

00:19.320 --> 00:24.907
Tonight the Wuzhao camp is brightly lit they must be planning strategy.

00:25.120 --> 00:27.787
I'm afraid they'll launch a major attack tomorrow.

00:31.880 --> 00:33.280
Aren't you afraid?

00:34.800 --> 00:38.667
Xuan people in the north what is there to fear?

00:39.440 --> 00:43.760
Perhaps the only fear is that one day.

00:43.880 --> 00:46.160
We no longer believe we are Xuan people.

